      "id": 2,
      "text": "Two Bridges evolved from a 19th‑century immigrant enclave into a culturally layered neighborhood where 19th‑century tenements, mid‑20th‑century housing towers, and the steel spans of two iconic bridges coexist.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        5
