      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/two-bridges",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The George Washington Bridge, spanning the Hudson River, carries more vehicular traffic than any other bridge in the world.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
